{"unit_id":"Wei894348__dsh-wb2api#card-zh","repo":"Wei894348/dsh-wb2api","commit":"23a9db8597e2d46fa517d37a960cc78cd6ec2719","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wb2api-ui 是面向 DSH Web 的模型接入插件，可将 WorkBuddy 与 CodeBuddy 账号池连接为本机 OpenAI 兼容网关，并注册为可选的 LLM provider。插件托管网关进程、读取模型目录并把请求交给对应账号；Web 设置面板可查看网关和账号状态、管理凭证与积分，还提供成长任务扫描、执行和领奖。适合希望在 DSH 中使用现有 WorkBuddy 或 CodeBuddy 账号，并集中管理模型与任务的用户。需要 WorkBuddy 或 CodeBuddy 账号，网关在本机运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/gw/index.js:120","lib/index.js:1930","engine/wb_up/run.mjs:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Wei894348__dsh-wb2api#card-en","repo":"Wei894348/dsh-wb2api","commit":"23a9db8597e2d46fa517d37a960cc78cd6ec2719","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-wb2api-ui connects WorkBuddy and CodeBuddy account pools to DSH Web as a local model provider. It manages the gateway and offers a panel for models, credentials, account status, and credits. Its task engine runs growth tasks and claims rewards. A matching account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/gw/index.js:120","lib/index.js:1930","engine/wb_up/run.mjs:1"]}
